e world, and celebrating the 90th anniversary of New Farmers of America and the 75th anniversary of the Federal charter to Future Farmers of America.","type":"hres","updateDate":"2026-09-25T16:39:40Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-25T16:39:40Z"}
